
# 2025-11-21 18:14:52.545203
+Code the following app
+```
+Token Buy List — текст для успішного розгортання
+
+Title: Token Buy List
+
+Description:
+Create a simple app that allows users to maintain a personal list of tokens they plan to buy. The app should work fully locally, without internet access or external APIs. All data is entered and managed manually by the user.
+
+Functionality:
+ • Show an input field labeled “Token Name” where the user can type the token they want to add to their buy list.
+ • Include a button labeled “Add Token” that adds the entered token to a visible list on the page.
+ • Below the input, display a section titled “Your Buy List” showing all added tokens in a simple list format.
+ • Each token in the list should have a small “Remove” button next to it, allowing the user to delete individual tokens.
+ • Add a “Clear All” button that removes the entire list at once.
+ • Validate input: if the user tries to add an empty token name, show a message:
+“Please enter a token name.”
+
+UI Requirements:
+ • Use only basic UI elements like text fields, buttons, and lists.
+ • Layout should be clean and simple.
+ • All actions (add, remove, clear) must update the list instantly and locally.
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

